<li class="pillar"><span class="pn">1</span><h3>Causality in Strategic Decision Making</h3><p>How managers can reason about cause and effect before they act. Causal diagrams make a strategy’s theory of value explicit; causal discovery and structural causal models put it to the test.</p><ul>
<li><span>Mapping theories of value</span><small>Preparing for submission</small></li>
<li><a href="https://research.cbs.dk/en/publications/causal-discovery-in-strategic-management-research">Causal discovery in strategic management research</a><small>DRUID23</small></li>
<li><a href="https://journals.aom.org/doi/abs/10.5465/AMPROC.2023.12543abstract">Structural causal models in strategy</a><small>AoM Proceedings, 2023</small></li>
</ul></li>
<li class="pillar"><span class="pn">2</span><h3>Machine Learning and Simulacra in Entrepreneurship</h3><p>What machine learning, and now language models, can tell founders. From multimodal prediction of venture outcomes to silicon samples that simulate customer feedback before a product exists.</p><ul>
<li><span>Silicon sampling for product feedback in entrepreneurship</span><small>Working paper, 2026</small></li>
<li><a href="https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s11187-019-00218-w.pdf">Predicting outcomes in crowdfunding</a><small>Small Business Economics, 2020</small></li>
<li><span>Learning to frame</span><small>Resubmit</small></li>
</ul></li>
<li class="pillar"><span class="pn">3</span><h3>Economic Complexity of Software</h3><p>Software as a lens on what economies know how to do. With Juhász, Wachs and Hidalgo, measuring the complexity of the code that countries produce and how it relates to their development.</p><ul>
<li><a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.respol.2026.105422">The software complexity of nations</a><small>Research Policy, 2026</small></li>
<li><span>Creative complexity</span><small>Under review</small></li>
<li><a href="https://github.blog/news-insights/policy-news-and-insights/how-researchers-are-using-github-innovation-graph-data-to-reveal-the-digital-complexity-of-nations/">How researchers are using GitHub Innovation Graph data to reveal the “digital complexity” of nations</a><small>GitHub Blog, 2026</small></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
